Z||000000||ToddAsh||01-15-2001||01:31 AM||||Just got Classic tags for my '85.Haven't seen any on a Fiero. In Pa. it means no more emission testing, one time plate fee of $75 and insurance for $150 a year.Only catch is your only supposed to drive about one day a week.My '85 SE only has 15,162 miles so far.I love it. Looking for a '88 GT with Automatic.Fiero=CLASSIC. I never would have thought it until I drove one.Nothing like it.Todd||||reg||1
